    "limitations": [
      "Independent experimental source discovery; no specialist legal review or full Foundry production assurance.",
      "Authored references are navigation; explicit semantic relations are source-backed model proposals awaiting specialist review. PDF page containment is deterministically derived.",
      "Machine extraction has known defects. Full-DMG search includes clearly labelled historical amendments; the preserved Pension Credit pilot keeps them outside its default page search.",
      "ADM is a separate frozen source family. Corpus-wide page retrieval does not establish complete policy modelling or an answerability profile.",
      "The preserved custody context and its immutable acceptance receipts retain their original source and consumer versions.",
      "The additive combined Reader and staff semantic projection preserve earlier releases. Forty development profiles contain named unmet obligations; none establishes a complete answer or independent specialist acceptance.",
      "Verified provision reference metadata is navigation only. It does not contain statutory body evidence or establish commencement, extent for an individual case, or legal applicability.",
      "The additive household candidate includes 20 selected dated statutory units as derived, unreviewed extractions; this does not resolve complete legal dependencies, commencement, applicability or specialist review. Earlier reference-only outputs and receipts keep their original scope.",
      "Logical-unit mode is additive. All extracted bytes are accounted, but machine boundaries remain uncertain; separately authored dependencies and profiles are unreviewed and do not satisfy frozen page-level obligations.",
      "The manual guide records local conventions with exact frozen source support. Its 513-document census retains original roles; a convention observed in one document is not asserted across the manuals.",
      "The Chapter 60 reading-help projection is a two-paragraph, occurrence-bound, unreviewed reading aid. Original model-authored proposals and printed ambiguities retain their status; no legal definition, answerability or corpus-wide selection is established.",
      "Retained PDF tag trees are source-declared structural observations, not accepted semantic or legal interpretations. Bounded replay preserves original observations, unparsed lines and failed or absent structures; normal checks do not invoke Poppler or acquire sources.",
      "The additive structured-unit and structured-context candidates separate source locations, proposed content boundaries and compact discovery cards. A card supplies navigation, not evidence or a complete rule; dependency matches and better segmentation do not establish legal applicability or complete answerability.",
      "Guarded source-selection profiles are model-derived research proposals. The separate location-migration ledger preserves the 40 earlier staff requirements and 203 open obligations; exact overlap provides navigation only and never substitutes for an original required page or relationship path.",
      "The separate custody-migration ledger preserves six original acceptance requirements and distinguishes location-only mappings from narrower source-read selections. New scope records preserve exact historical source text; chapter routes and uncertain boundaries are not legal completeness.",
      "The evidence-connect overlay and workbench retain public question packages for inspection. Everyday-wording routes are authored navigation proposals, not legal applicability. Bounded delivery preserves incomplete status and cannot supply missing evidence."
    ]
